00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.260
Arpanet is known as the predecessor

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.780
to the internet that we all know and love.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.730
It consisted of a series of machines

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.130
that were connected
