It'll probably help you to imagine

00:29:24.040 --> 00:29:26.290
how you might end up using
this in your day-to-day

00:29:26.290 --> 00:29:28.900
coding journey, most applications

00:29:28.900 --> 00:29:31.120
that have users authenticate
have some pretty

00:29:31.120 --> 00:29:32.470
