are being sent out.

00:30:31.390 --> 00:30:33.760
The IP address that you send messages from

00:30:33.760 --> 00:30:35.620
has its own reputation.

00:30:35.620 --> 00:30:39.010
A best practice worth exploring
is to keep the senders

00:30:39.010 --> 00:30:41.350
